From df78b5a4dbfdac572a3a861ae2f4f0ec6c91c352 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Houdek <Sonicadvance1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:22:14 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Ensure serialize isn't covering too much of the instruction
 space

Makes sure to jump to the second indirect table so it doesn't cover the
whole row. This time with unittests to ensure it is correct.

Supercedes #6113.

(cherry picked from commit bfad5d69255b41d39ee901df5843a3e25ee80d35)
---
 FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/DiskCache.h     |   2 +-
 FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/Frontend.cpp    |  13 ++-
 .../OpcodeDispatcher/SecondaryGroupTables.h   |   2 -
 .../OpcodeDispatcher/SecondaryModRMTables.h   |   7 +-
 .../Core/X86Tables/SecondaryGroupTables.cpp   |  20 ++--
 .../Core/X86Tables/SecondaryModRMTables.cpp   |  30 ++++--
 .../Interface/Core/X86Tables/X86Tables.h      |   3 +-
 .../tests/signal/invalid_group_7_row5.cpp     | 102 ++++++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 152 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 unittests/FEXLinuxTests/tests/signal/invalid_group_7_row5.cpp

